<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A0.SSx7" title="In A.6 Example of constraint pass evaluation ‣ A.5 Case of the structured schema ‣ Towards Adaptive ML Benchmarks: Web-Agent-Driven Construction, Domain Expansion, and Metric Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">A.7  Original experimental results on TAM-Bench Lite Version</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A0.SSx8" title="In A.7 Original experimental results on TAM-Bench Lite Version ‣ A.6 Example of constraint pass evaluation ‣ A.5 Case of the structured schema ‣ Towards Adaptive ML Benchmarks: Web-Agent-Driven Construction, Domain Expansion, and Metric Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">A.8  Original experimental results on TAM-Bench Lite Version</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
