<section id="A0.SSx8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.8  Original experimental results on TAM-Bench Lite Version</h3>

<div id="A0.SSx8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A0.SSx8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table 10 lists the 18 competitions included in the Lite version of TAM-Bench, along with their associated data modalities and difficulty levels.
Table 11 lists the 54 competitions included in the Medium version of TAM-Bench, along with their associated data modalities and difficulty levels.
Table 12 lists the 18 competitions included in the Full version of TAM-Bench, along with their associated data modalities and difficulty levels.</p>
</div>
